# ============================================================

# Downloaded IMDb dataset folders
/Task-04-NLP-Sentiment-Classification/data/
/Task-04-NLP-Sentiment-Classification/dataset/

# Large raw dataset formats
/Task-04-NLP-Sentiment-Classification/*.parquet
/Task-04-NLP-Sentiment-Classification/*.tar.gz
/Task-04-NLP-Sentiment-Classification/*.zip

# Generated full IMDb CSV dataset
/Task-04-NLP-Sentiment-Classification/imdb_reviews.csv

